---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Section id="about" index="02" title="About" subtitle="A little context">
  <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-[160px_1fr] sm:gap-12">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-600">Focus</p>
    <div class="space-y-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone-600">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink">
        I'm a backend engineer first, drawn to the parts of a product you don't see: the data
        model, the API contract, the pipeline, the failure mode at 2am.
      </p>
      <p>
        I start with the business requirement rather than the tech stack. What decision does this
        enable? What does the use case actually look like? What does “correct” mean in production,
        and what will it cost to run? Then I design the system, and step across the stack when the
        product needs it.
      </p>
      <p>
        That's taken me across WhatsApp commerce, utility payments, fintech and healthcare:
        architecting event-driven flows, owning production support, partnering with product and
        design teams, and mentoring 80+ developers along the way.
      </p>
      <p class="border-l-2 border-accent/60 pl-4 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-600">
        {site.currently}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
